  "definition_ja": "単項式では、かけ合わされている文字の個数（3x²y の次数は 3）。多項式では、各項の次数のうちで最も大きいもの。",
  "definition_en": "For a monomial, the number of variable factors multiplied together, which is the sum of the exponents; the degree of 3x²y is 3. For a polynomial, it is the greatest degree among its terms.",
  "latex": null,
  "spoken_en": null,
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": "x squared y has degree 3: add the exponents, 2 for the x and 1 for the y.",
      "ja": "x²y の次数は 3。指数を足すんだ。x が 2 で y が 1 だからね。",
      "register": "spoken"
    },
    {
      "en": "State the degree of the polynomial 4x³ − 2x²y² + 7.",
      "ja": "多項式 4x³ − 2x²y² + 7 の次数を答えよ。",
      "register": "written"
    }
